# Project Specification & Master Roadmap: Habit & Task Tracker (Python + Flet + SQLite)

## 1. Architecture & Tech Stack Overview
- **Frontend (`app.py`)**: Single-page reactive Flet desktop/mobile UI organized into modular section markers (`SECTION A1` through `SECTION A9`).
- **Backend (`backend.py`)**: Local SQLite database (`tasks.db` / `habits`) managing tasks, recurring schedules, completion logs with quantifiable units, and multi-goal tracking (`SECTION B1` through `SECTION B5`).
- **Navigation**: 5 main views accessible via top navigation bar or keyboard shortcuts (`1`–`5`), plus arrow-key task navigation, `T` to snap to today, and `Enter`/`Space` to toggle completion.
- **Date Formatting Standard**:
  - **View 1 Day Header ONLY**: Includes weekday & ISO week (`Tue, 03 Nov 2026 • W45`).
  - **Everywhere Else (Buttons, Pickers, Cards, Tooltips)**: Clean date without weekday (`03 Nov 2026` or `DD-MM-YYYY` in text inputs).

