## 2. Completed Features (✅ DONE)

### View 1: Schedule & Today (`SECTION A4`)
- **Day / Week / Month Views**: Right-rail mode switcher (clickable + mouse-wheel scrollable) and bottom dot navigation for jumping across days, weeks, and months.
- **Task Completion & Unit Logging**: Checking off a recurring habit with a unit opens a quick-log banner (`unit_popup_banner`) to record numeric amounts (`kg`, `pages`, `mins`, etc.).
- **Inline Task Expansion Editor (`SUB-SECTION A5b`)**: Clicking the `⋮` button on any task card in Day View or Backlog expands an inline drawer to edit name, category, unit, notes, start/end dates, and recurrence without leaving the view, including a two-step delete confirmation safeguard.

### View 2: Add Task / Habit Form (`SECTION A5`)
- **Custom Graphical Calendar Popups**: Interactive start-date and end-date mini-calendars with quick duration preset chips (`2 Weeks`, `1 Month`, `3 Months`, `1 Year`).
- **Visual Recurrence Builder**: Toggle between One-Time Task and Recurring Habit (`Weekly / Daily` with interactive day balls, `Monthly / Yearly` with 12-month grid, and `Every X Days` custom interval).

### View 3: Backlog Queue (`SECTION A6`)
- **Unscheduled Task Queue**: Lists unscheduled items with 1-click `Today` / `Tmrw` scheduling buttons, direct completion checkbox (logs to today), and inline editing.

### View 4: Habits & Data Dashboard (`SECTION A2` & `SECTION A7`)
- **Scope Filtering & Custom Date Range Inspector**: Filter by Global, Category, or Individual Habit, with `DD-MM-YYYY` start/end date bounds filtering.
- **Streak & Consistency Cards**: Calculates Current Streak, Best Streak, Completion Rate %, and Completed vs. Missed scheduled occurrences up to today.
- **Anki-Style Review Heatmap**: Monday–Sunday aligned grid with month headers, 5-level neon green intensity scale, today highlight border, and subtle dots (`·`) for unscheduled days on non-daily habits.
- **Anki-Style Auto-Condensing SVG Unit Progression Graph (`build_area_line_chart_image`)**:
  - Fixed `680px` viewport width that automatically condenses bars/dots and thins X-axis labels as completion history grows.
  - **Style Toggle**: `Line (Connected Dots)` vs. `Pillars (Bars)`.
  - **Time Grouping Toggle**: `Daily` (with faint vertical dashed ISO week separator lines) vs. `By Week` (with sub-toggle for `Wk Avg` vs. `Wk Total`).
  - **Average Line Toggle**: `Running Avg`, `Weekly (Session) Avg` (ignores missed/unlogged days), or `Hide`—rendered in foreground Sky-Blue (`#38BDF8`) with a right-margin badge.
  - **Multi-Goal Engine & Left-Aligned Benchmarks**: Create Peak/Max, Weekly Average, or Overall Average goals with optional target deadlines. Active goals render in full-width Soft Violet (`#C084FC`) with left-aligned badges (`🎯 Max: 50`) so they never collide with the right-hand average badge.
  - **Precision & Tooltips**: All graph numbers rounded to max 2 decimals; native SVG `<title>` hover tooltips on points/bars.

### View 5: All Database Tasks (`SECTION A8`)
- **Database Inspector & Batch Delete**: Displays all tasks in SQLite with a `Select / Delete` batch mode and confirmation banner.

